{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07303","headline":"无锡东郭送友人游越 · 刘长卿","name":"无锡东郭送友人游越","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客路风霜晓，郊原春兴余。\n平芜不可望，游子去何如。\n烟水乘湖阔，云山适越初。\n旧都怀作赋，古穴觅藏书。\n碑缺曹娥宅，林荒逸少居。\n江湖无限意，非独爲樵渔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07303.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07303","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}